Studio began as a fork of ScriptBreak and consolidates behaviour and data models from
several suite applications into a single application:

  ScriptBreak                  screenplay parsing, breakdown, bibles, look, shot list,
                               scheduling, prompt packs, export
  Cork Board                   index cards, status columns
  Slate                        per-shot prompts, prompt history, take logging
  Circle Take                  take ratings and provenance
  Storyboard Reference Studio  frame/shot metadata concepts

The original applications remain available from their own repositories under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE for the full license text.

Changes made in this fork are described in ARCHITECTURE.md.
